#2998=IFCDOORTYPE('344O0TlNbNAhYUCAXYA2Tw',$,'D3','Flat entry door, 36 x 84 in. A 1-hour fire door assembly, self-closing and latching: it opens into the stair, the building''s one exit (IBC 2018 1023.2, Table 716.1(2), 716.2.6).',$,(#2999),$,$,$,.DOOR.,.NOTDEFINED.,$,$);
